# C1 does not hold in the block model when the hoisted op is a branch.
# Both arms hold `if c2 { x q3 }`, and c2 is known late. M0 hoists it. The
# controller then decides it first, and the outer branch (with `reset q4`)
# waits. See README.txt.
qubits 5
bits 3
h q0
measure q0 -> c0
h q2
h q2
h q2
h q2
h q2
h q2
h q2
measure q2 -> c2
if c0 {
  reset q4
  if c2 {
    x q3
  }
} else {
  if c2 {
    x q3
  }
}
